<Base title="Support the Mission" description="Learn about planned giving and sponsor opportunities for GEAR Moto Foundation.">
<section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Help Build GEAR</div><h1>Ride Together.<br/><span class="accent">Give Purpose.</span></h1></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Building a Sustainable Rider-Support Foundation</h2><p>The proposed development program combines individual gifts, recurring support, sponsorships, equipment donations, community events and foundation grants. Our aim is to build long-term programs, not depend on a single fundraising event.</p><h2>Four Ways Contributions Could Help</h2><ul><li><strong>Gear:</strong> Protective equipment, helmet access and related safety needs.</li><li><strong>Education:</strong> Rider training and educational awards.</li><li><strong>Assistance:</strong> Resource navigation, referrals and practical service connections.</li><li><strong>Recovery:</strong> Accident-related medical relief, eligible hardship expenses and rebuilding support.</li></ul><h2>Support Options Under Development</h2><p>We are planning a Founding 100 community campaign, monthly supporters, corporate and community sponsors, event hosts, and in-kind partnerships. These are development concepts—not currently active donation products.</p><div class="program-callout"><strong>Online giving is not open.</strong> Secure donation processing and tax-status documentation have not been confirmed. Do not send payments or sensitive financial information by email. We will not represent donations as tax deductible without a verified legal basis.</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/partners/">Explore Partnerships</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Giving%20Inquiry">Ask About Supporting GEAR</a></div><p>For questions about future giving opportunities or donor support, email <a href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org">donate@gearmotofoundation.org</a>.</p></div></section></Base>